message: "If you use weaver-spec, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "weaver-spec: shared contracts and invariants for the Weaver Stack"
abstract: >-
  weaver-spec is the documentation-and-contracts source of truth for the Weaver
  Stack (contextweaver, agent-kernel, ChainWeaver): language-agnostic JSON
  Schemas, a stdlib-only Python mirror package, invariants, and responsibility
  boundaries that keep the ecosystem composable and compatible.
